window.products.push({"id":629095,"name":"Quility Premium Removable Duvet Cover for Blankets 41\"x60\" Single Size Bed 100% Cotton Fabric Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412V5h2pqOS._AC_.jpg","description":"Quility’s innovative Premium 7-layered Blanket is designed to offer supreme comfort. With the most advanced sewing technology and the highest-quality, durable materials to produce the ideal blanket. The ultra-breathable, 100%-cotton outer layer is lined with non-glue polyester padding and two extra polyester layers that contain millions of premium micro glass beads. This structure provides optimal temperature control and our blankets never leak beads. Choose the right size for an individual user with a single, twin, or full-size bed, we recommend choosing a blanket that weighs around 10-12% of your body weight, (plus one pound). If the final weight falls equally between two blanket sizes, it’s best to go with the lighter option. Choosing the right size is crucial for enjoying the optimal benefits the Quility Blanket provides. For assistance choosing the right size for you, check out the helpful chart below","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412V5h2pqOS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quility","source_asin":"B07L2HPY5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L2HPY5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L2HPY5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":629096,"name":"Heavenera 18X18 Cotton Macrame Throw Pillow Handmade Indoor Outdoor Macrame Pillowcase Pillow Shams Designer Bohemian Throw Pillow Covers for Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TRBhZvOrL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Welcome to our store Heavenera® where Everything is awesome! Material and Size :- The pillow case is made up of premium handknotted Cotton Macrame cord with Cotton Backing. Size :- 2pcs of 18\"X18\" cotton macrame throw pillow covers (please allow little variation as the boho pillow covers are completely made by hand - from weaving of fabric to cutting, stitching, all process are manual. Please use one size bigger insert -20”X20” for fuller look. Pillow Insert not included.) Design and Pattern :- The decorative pillow features intricate macrame pattern which are handknotted by women in rural using environment friendly cotton cords. Value Pack :- You receive 2 pcs Heavenera boho macrame pillow Covers in One pack. Value pack for greater saving. Natural Material :- Our cushion is made up of 100% natural material and biodegradable ♻, so finally when the time comes and you need to discard them, mother Earth 🌍 will take it back to herself happily. Sturdy Material :- Heavenera® boho throw pillow covers are made with high quality material and have passed strict quality check. The metal zips at back of the fabric are durable, and the cotton fabric is tested to last. Handmade & Rural Employment :- Every knots are made by hand. It requires a lot of attention and care to create each piece. Please allow minor variation in sizes and design as total process are handmade. Macrame cushion covers are made by women in rural Indian village. It provide them a means to earn their own living and employment. Care Instructions :- With proper care, the decorative boho throw pillow covers will last long. Spot clean with a damp cloth, and then allow to air dry. You can dry clean or you can also handwash in cold water and flat dry. Stay tuned for more awesome things.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TRBhZvOrL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heavenera","source_asin":"B09HH9BS3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HH9BS3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HH9BS3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
