window.products.push({"id":629150,"name":"StrongTek Bamboo Toilet Stool, Foldable Squatting Poop Stool, Heavy-Duty Hinge Accessory, Good for Colon Health, Constipation, and Hemorrhoids (Natura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xTM0WOuYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Heavy-Duty Hinge: Our bamboo squatting stool features a unique heavy-duty metal hinge that avoids injury and prevents collapsing, ensuring safety for all users. Unlike regular folding toilet stools that use light screws and springs, our upgraded hinge is easy to use and extends the poop stool's lifespan. High Weight Capacity and Multi-Use: Our toilet stool, made of 0.67-inch thick bamboo board, can hold up to 400lbs, making it perfect for various body types. Its high weight capacity and lightweight design make it ideal not only as a toilet stool but also as a bamboo stepping stool for reaching high places. Convenient Folding and Easy Storage: Our bamboo toilet stool is easy to fold, even for seniors and children. Its folding feature makes it easy to carry around when traveling and to store away when not in use. After folding, this poop stool is only 2.75 inches high, taking up minimal space in your home. Hidden Handle Design: Our bamboo toilet stool features a unique design with large square cutouts on both sides that serve as handles for easy carrying. The cutout design reduces the poop stool's weight, avoiding material waste and making it less cumbersome. Plus, the handles allow you to move the squatting stool without touching the surface with your feet. Promotes Healthy Bowel Movement: Using a regular 90-degree sitting position for bowel movements can be harmful to colon health and may lead to constipation, hemorrhoids, and other diseases. Our bamboo toilet stool, also known as a squatting stool, simulates a natural squatting position, relaxing the colon muscles and making bowel movements smoother. Correctly using our toilet stool can significantly improve your quality of life and promote better digestive health.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xTM0WOuYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StrongTek","source_asin":"B0BWJFGTCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJFGTCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJFGTCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
