window.products.push({"id":629158,"name":"【New 】 Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser, Touchless Infrared Motion Sensor Soap Pump Hand Free Countertop Soap Dispensers for Bathroom Kitchen, 250ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TWNAJThwL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","description":"Specifications： Weight: 0.26kg Material: ABS plastic Capacity: 250ml/8.8oz Waterproof Rating: IPX4 Dimensions: 3.3x 4.7x 8.1 inches Power Supply: 4 x AA Battery ( not included ) Product Features： - High-quality rubber outlet with leak-proof and drip-proof design. - 250ml/8.8oz of large capacity. You don't bother to refill the soap dispenser from time to time. - Dilute the liquid with water proportionally and pour it into the container, the soap dispenser will make rich foam. - Precise IR sensor makes you no need to manually pump or rub a bar of soap on your hands for washing anymore. - Perfect for holding hand soap, hand cream, body lotion, shower gel, shampoo, laundry detergent, dish detergent, washing solution and disinfectant in car, kitchen, bathroom, toilet, office, school, kindergarten, hospital, hotel and restaurant，etc. Advantages of Using a Foaming Soap Dispenser： ♥♥1.  Friendly to Environment ♥Foaming hand soap can be used to lather by the dispenser and water only need to be used to wash the soap away which can reduce water usage during hand washing by up to 45%. ♥♥2. High Capability Price Ratio ♥Foaming soap dispensers release less soap than regular liquid soap dispensers do which allowing users to achieve the same level of cleanliness with less time, soap and water. ♥♥3. Keep Bacteria Far Away from Your Life. ♥Precise infrared sensor ensure hands-free operation which helps to avoid cross infection, improve hand hygiene and bring you the healthier and bioclean life. Package Included： 1 * Syringe 1 * Operation Manual 1 * Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TWNAJThwL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B084WV6BQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084WV6BQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084WV6BQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
