window.products.push({"id":629189,"name":"Deco 79 Rack Wall Hook, 20\" L x 2\" W x 10\" H, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GxQi4cpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The wooden cityscape of this wall hook rack brings a vintage feel with a European essence to your space. The five side-by-side buildings have a Dutch landscape look and are finish in muted, versatile tones, including white, light gray, dark gray, and golden beige. Not only is this a wall decor piece, but beneath each building is a long metal drop hook to hang lightweight sweaters and jackets, umbrellas, hats, or anything else you wish to keep organized and off the floor. Hang in your entryway or even your kitchen for a fun way to hang aprons and utensils. Item is ready to hang by keyhole slots in the back. This item comes shipped in one carton. Each hook holds 5 to 8 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GxQi4cpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B08QWCB92G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QWCB92G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QWCB92G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
