window.products.push({"id":629280,"name":"OE Coda Espresso Knock Box & Coffee Recycling System with LID - New!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVDOPY7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The OE Coda Knock Box is a complete coffee waste recycling system. It has a small footprint, but the tall fluted shape gives it a large capacity - 20 full size pucks, or 2 quarts of ground coffee. The non marking rubber base is removable, and a solid rubber disk seals the bottom for knock box format, or the stainless steel screen can be substituted to use as an in-sink filter, for the collection of spent brew grinds for recycling. The Knock Bar is made of Delrin, with a vinyl tube covering for a quiet but sure knock! The Coda comes with a tight fitting rubber lid (a very nice feature if you share kitchen space with a non-coffee person!). ABS body, and Santoprene Rubber Base are dishwasher safe. Designed, and Assembled in Idaho, USA. The ABS Cone, lid, base & screen parts are made in Taiwan. Recycling your coffee to your compost or garden, is a good thing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVDOPY7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orphan Espresso","source_asin":"B00QLPJDII","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QLPJDII","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QLPJDII","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
