window.products.push({"id":629431,"name":"Wilton 12-Cavity Whoopie Pie Baking Pan, Makes Individual 3\" Diameter Baked Goods and Treats, Non-Stick and Dishwasher-Safe, Enjoy or Give as Gift, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c8OCgpfkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A taste of sweet nostalgia, whoopie pies were introduced generations ago, when American country homemakers placed them inside lunch boxes as an afternoon surprise. The luscious cream filling inside the cake-like sandwich cookies were supposedly named after the shouts of delight from anyone who tasted them. Now you can make your own right at home with this 12-cavity Whoopie Pie Baking Pan from Wilton. Great for family projects, baked whoopie pies are easier to make and healthier than fried. The non-stick, 12-cavity pan is perfect for baking your favorite recipes. Don't limit yourself to just plain whoopie pies with this pan - use different flavors, even chocolate or strawberry batter to make delicious treats that you can decorate for all seasons and holidays. Browse dozens of recipes on the Wilton website or create your own like Mom used to make. Custom decorated whoopie pie desserts make wonderful gifts for new neighbors or as appreciation gifts for your favorite school teacher. When done baking and creating, this durable pan cleans up easily in the dishwasher. It is covered by a limited 10-year warranty. Wilton helps families celebrate! We inspire the joy of creativity in everyone, everywhere, every day. Since 1929, Wilton has been helping home bakers and cake decorators all over the world create sweet treats and beautiful desserts by giving them the tools to make it fun and easy. The Wilton name is known around the world for cake decorating, candy making, bakeware and party products. At Wilton, we're passionate about bringing the love of baking and decorating to every consumer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c8OCgpfkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B07FZQ4FVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZQ4FVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZQ4FVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
