window.products.push({"id":629500,"name":"Wooden Cremation Urn - Ambassador Shape with Cardinal Bird 3-Dimensional Inlay Wood Art Memorial - Funeral Urns for Adults (Solid Maple Wood)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819w9kkdyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This timeless and elegant wood funeral urn is made in the USA, in an Oregon woodshop. The Cardinal Bird wood inlay art scene showcases a stunning red cardinal, resting on a branch and reminding you that, \"When a cardinal appears in your yard, it's a visitor from heaven.\" The laser etched inlay is composed of select hardwoods in their natural colors, set into the wood urn to give the look and feel of three dimensions. A lovely memorial urn tribute to the one who loved birds, nature, wildlife, and the great outdoors. The inlay art scene is laser engraved with a variety of hardwoods that accent the vibrant red cardinal, the cardinal itself features a rich red stain. This funeral urn has an industry-standard adult urn capacity of over 200 cubic inches. This capacity is equal to the remains (or \"ashes\") of a person who weighed up to 200 lbs. These wooden urns are individually crafted to order right here in the USA. Please allow 1-3 business days for production. The Cardinal Urn is available in your choice of premium Mahogany, Maple, Oak, and Walnut woods, crafted in our enduringly popular Ambassador funeral urn shape. Thick, premium hardwoods are used, making this a solid and lasting heirloom urn with a natural clear finish. Usage: Bottom-opening panel attaches with standard screws. To open, simply remove the screws and bottom panel, place the plastic bag containing the cremated remains into the urn, and re-attach the panel. No need for sealant or glue. Exterior dimensions: 11\" wide, 9\" high, 7.5\" deep. Urns Northwest has been your premier source for cremation urns since 2000, with the highest standards in craftsmanship, quality, and customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819w9kkdyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urns Northwest","source_asin":"B06Y26KDDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y26KDDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y26KDDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
