window.products.push({"id":629661,"name":"JUDYRBDIAL Soft Acrylic Knit Throw Blanket 50\" x 60\" Lightweight Decorative Blanket with 8\" Tassel for Sofa, Couch, Bed | Orange Grid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lxZys68iL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Super Soft Knitted Fabric】 Made of soft acrylic like wool, silky to touch, ultra-soft,comfortable, and lightweight to use. This decorative woven blanket with high knitted density provides warmth continuously for you wherever you are. 【Grid Pattern & Tassel Design】Diamond knitted pattern with solid color makes this throw become more unique and trendy. The 8 inches tassel on both sides is made up of different fineness and durable short fibers, which adds more style to this throw. 【50\"×60\" Throw Size with 8\" Tassel】One size fits for multi-purpose. Just perfect size to use for any person and purpose like using it for a sofa, couch, bed, guest bedroom, office. Make you feel more comfortable and gently wrapped inside and keep you cozy on a crisp night. It is the perfect addition to any home decor. 【Year Round Use】 Our knitted throw can be used all season, and it is extremely soft and comfortable to use all year round. Due to its lightweight feature(weighed 1.1 lbs), it is great for use when traveling, go camping. Perfect to be as an air conditioning blanket in summer but also warm enough to use even in winter or cold weather. Our decorative throw also can be a shawl or scarf,which can increase your infinite charm. 【Easy Care】 Machine washable separately in cold water. Do not wring and bleach, lay flat to dry, natural air for good. No chlorine bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lxZys68iL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUDYBRIDAL","source_asin":"B08DQQ2HJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DQQ2HJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DQQ2HJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":629662,"name":"Kombucha Starter Kit with kombucha SCOBY, starter tea, organic sugar, black tea, pH strips, thermometer, coffee filters, rubber band, instructions - K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SDrNf5aHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LET US TAKE THE STRESS OUT OF BREWING FOR YOU! Our Kombucha Starter Kit was designed to address and eliminate issues that new kombucha brewers often encounter. Start brewing kombucha at home for life with this kit! HAVE A BREWING JAR ALREADY? THIS KIT CONTAINS EVERYTHING ELSE YOU NEED TO BREW BY THE GALLON! This kombucha starter kit comes with a high-quality active SCOBY with strong starter tea, certified organic cane sugar, an 80-pack of pH strips, an adhesive thermometer, 3 Tbsp black tea blend, a cotton tea bag, 2 coffee filters, a rubber band, and straightforward instructions to walk you through your entire first brew! HIGH-QUALITY: Our SCOBYs are grown with certified organic sugar and all-natural loose leaf black tea-- they are kept fresh and active until shipment to ensure you receive an active, happy, & healthy product! Each kombucha SCOBY is also packaged and shipped with strong starter tea! COFFEE FILTERS vs. CHEESECLOTH: A quick Google search will confirm coffee filters are superior to cheesecloth for home brewing Kombucha: cheesecloth can let in bugs, harmful bacteria, and other unwanted critters with the potential to ruin your kombucha brew! Protect your brew properly with the included filters! Coffee filters can also be easily reused and recycled JOIN A COMMUNITY OF KOMBUCHA HOME-BREWERS! The Kombucha Starter Kit gives you access to the Bucha Brewers support team as well as countless guides, recipes, and additional Kombucha brewing resources! Welcome to the Bucha Brewers community!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SDrNf5aHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bucha Brewers","source_asin":"B07P2RMR95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P2RMR95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P2RMR95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
