window.products.push({"id":629760,"name":"Digging Dolls: 5 pcs of Natural White Selenite Sticklet Wands - 5 Inch avg. - Perfect for Crystal Healing, Cleansing, Reiki and Much More!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y3o-p17hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and most spectacular stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.These Selenite Sticklets are perfect for many different purposes including home decor, wedding decor, spa decor, salon decor, reiki, office decor, specimens, collecting, gift giving and so much more! As a naturally earth mined and hand broken stone you may find some of your sticklets are thinner or wider than the ones shown. If you would prefer a certain size please contact us prior to purchase to ensure you receive a the size you need as the pieces are normally pulled at random but we are happy to customize the sizing when requested. Our Dolls meet with the mine owners multiple times per year and scrutinize every shipment of Selenite to ensure they meet the high standards required to be part of the Digging Dolls brand.Every sticklet is unique and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As earth mined specimen pieces it is possible the sticklets may include possible minor flaws, imperfections, variance in colors, shapes, sizes, and patterns in every one.Please Note: These sticklets are Selenite which is a variation of gypsum and it does have a tendency to \"shed\" meaning you may find in your box or on your counter some small pieces or slivers that have come off of your piece. This is NATURAL for this material and this is not a defect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y3o-p17hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B07NYT48S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NYT48S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NYT48S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
