window.products.push({"id":629774,"name":"A.J.A. & MORE Lint Holder Bin and Dryer Sheet Dispenser Magnetic for Laundry Room Organization (Matte Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CchwhmOuL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"✅ 1-2 ORGANIZATION COMBO: Easily upgrade your laundry room decor, with these delightfully complimentary magnetic bins; the classic original Lint Bin and Dryer Sheet Dispenser. One serves as a caddy for your dryer sheets, dryer balls, detergent pods, stain remover pens, scissors, etc. The other serves as a gentle reminder to check your lint screen after laundering. Avoid leaving your lint or used dryer sheets on the dryer or floor; what a laundry room pairing. ✅ SPACE SAVER DUO: Never enough space in laundry rooms or mud rooms, use minimal space to ensure maximum storage space. Brighten laundry day with more usable space and a minimalist look. Place the magnetic bins at arms length or at your finger tips, without bending over or reaching up. Imagine less back bending and time on the step stool. Alternatively, mount your bins to the wall like a laundry sign. ✅ ATTRACTIVE & SLEEK DESIGN: Transform your laundry room decor with these chic slim design holders, displaying a classic elegant script font as the first-to-market magnetic Lint Bin and Dryer Sheets Dispenser. Attach to the front or side of your washer or dryer or hang on the wall like décor. Laundry day heroes need these laundry storage organizers. Whether you spend a day or seven days home doing laundry, add a magnetic Pocket Treasures bin to round out your laundry room organization & storage ✅ ECO FRIENDLY REPURPOSE LINT: In the forever cycle of laundry, be earth friendly. Lint Bin makes it easier to eliminate the trash can and plastic trash bags or liners. Make a big impact reusing lint. Perhaps these will spark your interest; fire starters, planter liners, paper mache crafts, packing material, or use the natural fibers for mulch or compost. Why stop there? With the Dryer Sheet Dispenser, prevent wasting time looking for that box of fabric sheets or wool balls or even bleach pens","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CchwhmOuL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A.J.A. & MORE","source_asin":"B09C12H7KF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C12H7KF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C12H7KF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
