window.products.push({"id":629793,"name":"Umbra Cubiko Storage Unit, Modern Medicine Cabinet, Vanity, Bathroom Mirror, 24x12” Rectangle, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lcqYBlPxL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"A modern take on the traditional medicine cabinet, Cubiko is a mirror and storage unit designed to make the most of small space living. Tucked behind Cubiko’s mirror are convenient storage shelves that are easily accessible from either open side; saving you from having to fuss with a door like you do with a conventional bathroom medicine cabinet with mirror. This innovative design makes Cubiko ideal for storing bathroom accessories, daily essentials like car keys and sunglasses, and so much more. A great addition to any room that’s short on storage, Cubiko is made of rust-proof powder-coated steel, making it ideal for washrooms or other heavily trafficked areas around your home. Available in Two Shapes and SizesThe original Cubiko has 3 shelves, measures 12 x 24 x 5. 25 inches (30. 48 x 60. 96 x 13. 34 x cm), and can hold up to 40 lbs. (18. 14 kg). Cubiko Round has 2 shelves, a 20-inch diameter with a depth of 5. 25 inches (50. 8 x 13. 34 cm), and can also hold up to 40 lbs. (18. 14 kg). Need more mirror storage? Try placing two Cubiko’s side-by-side to instantly double the amount of useful storage space. For a modern take on the classic bathroom storage cabinet, order Cubiko from Umbra today. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lcqYBlPxL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B074F2JFJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F2JFJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F2JFJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
