window.products.push({"id":629900,"name":"KRUPS GX4100 Electric Spice Herbs and Coffee Grinder with Stainless Steel Blades and Housing, 3-Ounce, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bA3FUUdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Grind whole coffee beans in seconds with this powerful KRUPS GX4100-11 coffee, herb, and spice grinder. The round-shaped grinder offers a large grinding capacity that yields up to 15 cups of coffee, while its precision stainless-steel blades ensure even results. Use the pulse-action button to customize the consistency—from coarse to fine. For safety, the blades won’t spin without the lid securely in place. The grinder makes it easy to enjoy the rich aroma and delicious full-bodied flavor that comes with brewing coffee from freshly ground coffee beans. In addition to coffee beans, the versatile grinder can also be used for mincing fresh herbs and dried spices or chopping or grinding nuts and seeds. With its brushed stainless-steel finish, the KRUPS spice, herbs and coffee grinder offers attractive, everyday convenience. Amazon.com If you take the trouble to buy fresh gourmet coffee beans, you want a grinder that enhances the flavor and aroma of your morning brew. Krups has been making household grinders for years, and this shiny, chrome-finished mill is an attractive, easy-to-use choice for your beans. Two thick, straight blades guarantee even grinding, and with the pulse-touch button, the coarseness of the grind is completely up to you. Ever thought of making your own fresh curry powder? The grinder also works well with hard spices such as cloves and cardamom. Just wipe clean with a sponge or cloth between uses, and the lid is dishwasher-safe if it needs an extra scrub. --Jill Lightner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bA3FUUdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUPS","source_asin":"B07YSVCJX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSVCJX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSVCJX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
