window.products.push({"id":629967,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Winterberry 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jsKZS7trL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description As fall turns to winter, bright holly berries make their appearance, and the Pfaltzgraff Winterberry collection is the holiday classic that brings this timeless motif to life in elegantly sculpted dinnerware and serveware, beautiful glassware, and joyous giftware. This 16-piece Winterberry dinnerware set is perfect for everyday use and for casual entertaining. The dinnerware set includes 4 of each: dinner plate, salad plate, soup/cereal bowl, and mug. A wide selection of entertaining and serving pieces to complete your collection can be purchased separately. Create your ideal table setting with a full range of coordinating Winterberry dinnerware and serveware. This product is microwave safe and dishwasher safe. Amazon.com Even though they feature a wintertime pattern, you can use these Winterberry dishes any time of the year to remind you of the fun and beauty of winter. Each plate, bowl, and mug has a thin green stripe around the outer edge, a ring of holly berries and branches, and an embossed filigree pattern in white. The 16-piece set provides service for four, consisting of dinner plates, salad plates, soup/cereal bowls, and mugs. As with all Pfaltzgraff dishes, single replacement pieces are available for broken items. The stoneware is microwave-, oven-, freezer-, and dishwasher-safe. Five-year warranty. --Doree Armstrong","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jsKZS7trL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0001X0PCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001X0PCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001X0PCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":629968,"name":"RealSteel Metal Split Letter Monogram Sign - Personalized Metal Décor - Custom Last Name Sign - Monogram - Family Last Name Sign - Custom Metal Sign -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrS+ABCbL._AC_.jpg","description":"𝗔𝗱𝗱 𝗔 𝗣𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗼𝗻𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘇𝗲𝗱 𝗧𝗼𝘂𝗰𝗵 𝘁𝗼 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗛𝗼𝗺𝗲: Ever feel like something is missing from your decor? Complete your home's interior design with our last name monogram wall sign. Endlessly customizable, cement your family's heritage with a charming, rustic letter name sign. Whether you're a newlywed or decorating your first home, choose from our elegant powder coatings and enhance your bedroom, kitchen, stairs, or front door. 𝗖𝗿𝗮𝗳𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗳𝗿𝗼𝗺 𝗧𝗼𝘂𝗴𝗵 & 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗦𝘁𝗲𝗲𝗹: We understand your name represents your identity & legacy, so our family wall decor is meticulously made to order by our artisans. Designed from tough American steel, our monogram wall decor is made with quality in Texas. Hang it inside or outside your home for years - and decades - to come or pass it down as a family heirloom. Your monogram comes protected with our weather & rust resistant powder coating in your choice of colors. 𝗘𝗳𝗳𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘀𝗹𝘆 𝗠𝗼𝘂𝗻𝘁𝘀 𝗔𝗻𝘆𝘄𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲: Made to hang indoors & outdoors, mount your new house decor in your living room or hang it up as a front door sign. No matter where you hang it, welcome your guests with an elegant display made just for your abode. Make your name sign pop with our unique powder coatings and finalize any nook & cranny with a stylish personalized plaque. Choose from 5 sizes & up to 18 characters to distinguish your home from the rest. 𝗔 𝗚𝗶𝗳𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗙𝗿𝗶𝗲𝗻𝗱𝘀 & 𝗙𝗮𝗺𝗶𝗹𝘆 𝗪𝗶𝗹𝗹 𝗔𝗱𝗼𝗿𝗲: There's no better way to show how much you love your friends & family than our customizable steel letter name monogram. The perfect gift for a housewarming party, wedding, anniversary, or birthday, surprise your loved ones with a letter sign they can proudly display inside their home or wedding reception. 𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗦𝘁𝗲𝗲𝗹 𝗗𝗲𝗹𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹 𝗜𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗴𝗿𝗶𝘁𝘆: Our team puts their whole heart into each and every sign made. Your handsome new sign should meet all of your aesthetic and durability needs—we stand behind that goal, and offer a 5-year quality promise against defects. Become a part of the RealSteel family and feel free to give us a shout with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrS+ABCbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RealSteel","source_asin":"B0BKJRPH1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-629968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKJRPH1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKJRPH1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
